<h4>Additional Information</h4>
<ul>
<li>Genes without more than 10 counts in at least 2 samples are insignificant and filtered out.</li>
<li>4601 of 7127 (64.56%) genes were filtered out for low expression.</li>
<li>TMM was the method used to normalise library sizes.</li>
<li>The edgeR quasi-likelihood test was used with robust settings (robust=TRUE with estimateDisp and glmQLFit).</li>
<li>MD-Plot highlighted genes are significant at FDR of 1 and exhibit log2-fold-change of at least 0.</li>
</ul>
